  "details": "Currently, if you have an avatar in the Scene that is missing an Animator controller, the SDK goes blank.\n\nIt takes only one avatar for the SDK to break.\n\nThere is an error message in the Console, but I think it would be better if this was noted in the SDK window itself.\n\nI've seen many people confused by the SDK going blank.",
